  _id: L4
  _title: Guided play
  _menuDescription: 'Play chords and notes together. The same patterns as Swing, now with two hands.'
  _conceptExplanation: 
  _conceptSlides:
  - text: 'Now both hands play together. Your left hand plays the chords. Your right hand plays the notes.'
    seconds: 7
  - text: 'Left hand: make the shape for each chord, then strike down as a new bar begins.'
    seconds: 7
  - text: 'Right hand: curl a finger as each letter arrives, just like in Swing.'
    seconds: 6
  - text: 'The notes follow the same patterns you just played: up, up, down.'
    seconds: 6
